# ramify-agent's complete ignore list. It no longer inherits rules from a
# containing repository: the dependency, editor and generated-view rules below
# were carried from the Ramify toolkit's root .gitignore at
# 1d8a43fc6ba5c214f2a53d0411f4d7f832e70eb5, when this project was its
# ramify-agent/ directory.

# Dependency directories at any depth, and dependency symlinks a worktree
# setup may create.
node_modules

# Build output, including the web client's production build in dist/web/.
dist/

# Owner scratch directories.
**/src/tmp/

# Editor and agent-tool artifacts written into the project root, and an
# agent tool's personal local settings.
.history/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Materialized API-view catalogs, the materialized architect view and the
# publisher's reserved transient staging/rollback siblings of each, with the
# sibling marker file, `<sibling>.marker.json`, that a failed or interrupted
# publication can leave beside a sibling (defense against commits and
# project-wide searches; the generated-path predicate that isolates them at
# every runtime boundary is authoritative, not this file). Matches the closed
# enumeration only, at any depth: `.ramify`, `.ramify.tmp-<suffix>`,
# `.ramify.old-<suffix>`, `.ramify-architect`, `.ramify-architect.tmp-<suffix>`
# and `.ramify-architect.old-<suffix>`, and the four marker forms. Near-miss
# names such as `.ramify-other`, `.ramify-architects`, `.ramify.tmp` or
# `.ramify-architect.tmp` (no suffix) are ordinary and intentionally left
# tracked.
.ramify/
.ramify.tmp-*/
.ramify.old-*/
.ramify.tmp-*.marker.json
.ramify.old-*.marker.json
.ramify-architect/
.ramify-architect.tmp-*/
.ramify-architect.old-*/
.ramify-architect.tmp-*.marker.json
.ramify-architect.old-*.marker.json

# A harness run's records under plans/<plan>/.harness/ are ignored by the
# .gitignore the harness writes inside that directory, not by this file.

# Host-specific devcontainer Compose values (.devcontainer/.env.example lists them).
.devcontainer/.env
